{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "75f8d32e029c15d1393b9d8a0004fe6e600d80126ed71d05465c152f3afcc0be", "ja": "握手会を終えて", "zh": "握手会结束后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3000_place", "source_sha256": "f85c48935d35a0f40c2ac20225bc5f46401ad855ef9d14e033b7a2505516d23c", "ja": "握手会会場", "zh": "握手会会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3001_030iku", "source_sha256": "074dc62a306093beebac80e45bca047fef5efb11c77791e4726bd76608ebed88", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あくしゅ会おわったよ。\n200人の人とあくしゅしたら、すごく疲れた……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，握手会结束了喔。\n和200个人握手好累喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3002_p", "source_sha256": "244bed0ec2acaac312298713477fddb2e5d9396f4f325f3a691fff62fff84c6e", "ja": "（育……。今にも座り込んでしまいそうだ。やっぱり\n10歳の子に、200人との握手会はきつかったか）", "zh": "（育……已经累到快要站不住了，让10岁的孩子\n开200人的握手会还是太勉强了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3003", "source_sha256": "184133b85139526053996373223149eb7c39cea210a014ab4b66d48cf1747b80", "ja": "今すぐ帰ろう", "zh": "现在就回去吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3004", "source_sha256": "e635a3800bf8ae9553dee4063e24817f7012ceee7dfa8da55f91cc6910f179e8", "ja": "少し休んでいこう", "zh": "休息一下吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3200_p", "source_sha256": "3b21ff075c76d7998eb5f9941b83239cf0eaaa185f0a01138d53cd35f69e8a3c", "ja": "すぐに家に帰ろう。\n車までおぶってやるからな。", "zh": "我们现在就回家吧，\n我会背着你到车上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3201_030iku", "source_sha256": "0512201f580e6d3bbdb67ce0be6ac5317e2e182e0c9c871fae0a98f7835ed5b4", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとう、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3202_030iku", "source_sha256": "07c5f115650aefbe2a763fd9932614fe882b6d9db719818a640b43f49437b912", "ja": "今日はがんばったから、帰ったら\nおかあさんにオムライス作ってもらおーっと！", "zh": "我今天很努力了，回去之后\n我要拜托妈妈做蛋包饭给我吃──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3300_p", "source_sha256": "3b21ff075c76d7998eb5f9941b83239cf0eaaa185f0a01138d53cd35f69e8a3c", "ja": "すぐに家に帰ろう。\n車までおぶってやるからな。", "zh": "我们现在就回家吧，\n我会背着你到车上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3301_030iku", "source_sha256": "3b5e27a278155ace1903ee28bf04f4bfe9d31ac1a35479cedb1f25fb38e98c15", "ja": "おんぶなんて、小さい子みたいではずかしいよ。\nつかれちゃったから、今日はしかたないけど……。", "zh": "用背的好像小朋友一样，好难为情喔。\n可是今天很累，所以也没办法了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3500_p", "source_sha256": "f71b5fd7d40adda458925edf2cd2410df87d40ce420b4443bceac38a19f03f83", "ja": "そうか。それじゃ、\n少し控え室で休んでから帰ろうか。", "zh": "这样啊，要不然\n在准备室里歇一会再回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3501_030iku", "source_sha256": "d0037ba69ffde6f164b8ac4cc03bd0097031fd28c0716f886c200cb3a801f285", "ja": "ひかえ室にあったおかし、まだ食べてなかった。\nおかし食べたら、ちょっと元気になれるかも。", "zh": "我还没吃准备室里的点心，\n吃了点心之后，说不定会比较有精神一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3600_p", "source_sha256": "f71b5fd7d40adda458925edf2cd2410df87d40ce420b4443bceac38a19f03f83", "ja": "そうか。それじゃ、\n少し控え室で休んでから帰ろうか。", "zh": "这样啊，要不然\n在准备室里歇一会再回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_3601_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee69c8e75d539d17ff0b28aa03785742d490d673579d5e7a5e6f35d1e7a92c97", "ja": "うん……。ねむくなってきた。\nちょっとだけ、ねてもいい？", "zh": "嗯……我想睡觉了。\n可以睡一下下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
